**[PATTERN]:** Emergency mode introduces temporary suspension or modification of normal operational constraints (e.g., role exclusivity, request ordering), requiring state-dependent constraint activation/deactivation.

**[EVENT]:** Identified and separated assumptions requiring clarification about temporal simultaneity of emergency triggers, scope of mutual exclusivity suspension, and modeling of credential updates to avoid blocking abstract modeling.

