**[PATTERN]:** Defining a total and injective function `timeValue: Time -> Int` and using it consistently to perform all temporal arithmetic and comparisons avoids syntax errors related to time arithmetic.

**[EVENT]:** Replaced all direct arithmetic involving `Time` atoms with integer arithmetic on `timeValue` function results, fixing syntax errors and enabling model execution.

