- Parameterized concurrency window and emergency duration for flexibility.  
- Modeled mutual exclusivity suspension with explicit subsets and symmetric constraints.  
- Verified all incremental predicates and assertions pass with realistic instances.  
- Identified and documented assumptions requiring confirmation to reduce underspecification.  
- Recommended stronger assertions and scenario predicates targeting edge and negative cases.  
- Provided clear user questions and handoff items for requirements engineer collaboration.
